{"ts":"2026-08-25T05:13:05.253Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-5.6-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9b054e739855a3b67742faac","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-5.6-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-6x7o","lineage:pm-96h7","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-a8zm","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-6x7o","lineage:pm-96h7","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Migration ledger\n\n- initialize and notifications/initialized: replace with request-local metadata and server/discover.\n- ping: remove from canonical server and tests.\n- logging/setLevel: replace with request-local logLevel metadata, stderr for stdio, and OpenTelemetry for remote observability.\n- notifications/roots/list_changed and Roots: pass directories or files through tool parameters, resource URIs, or server configuration.\n- Sampling and includeContext legacy values: integrate directly with provider APIs when needed and omit or use none during compatibility.\n- HTTP+SSE, GET endpoints, session headers, and SSE resumability: replace with Streamable HTTP POST and explicit retry.\n- Dynamic Client Registration: prefer Client ID Metadata Documents with bounded fallback.\n- resources subscribe methods: replace with subscriptions/listen.\n\nEvery adapter declares owner, supported era, telemetry, security consequences, sunset evidence, and removal gate."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-vzcisw"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"MCP 2026-07-28 deprecation and removal migration: roots, sampling, logging, dynamic registration, HTTP+SSE, includeContext, ping, and legacy sessions"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Remove canonical use of deleted protocol methods and migrate every deprecated feature to the specified replacement while preserving only bounded evidence-backed compatibility adapters."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Chore"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:mcp","compatibility","deprecation","http-sse","logging","migration","roots","sampling"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-25T05:13:05.253Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-25T05:13:05.253Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":540},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A generated inventory finds every removed or deprecated symbol and classifies source, test, doc, package, and release-probe usage; Canonical 2026-07-28 code and public docs contain no initialize-state, ping, logging/setLevel, roots-change, legacy resource-subscription, session-header, SSE-resume, or tasks/result behavior; Every deprecated feature uses the specification migration path and has a dated compatibility and removal policy; Legacy adapters are isolated from canonical SDK policy and have protocol-era positive and negative tests; CI fails when a removed symbol or deprecated feature is reintroduced outside the explicit adapter allowlist"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"No new dependence on removed or deprecated MCP features"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Inventory every legacy feature in source, tests, docs, packages, examples, and release probes and migrate it to the 2026-07-28 path"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"The current implementation does not carry dead protocol state or teach agents patterns scheduled for removal"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The latest revision removes ping and several session or subscription behaviors and deprecates Roots, Sampling, Logging, Dynamic Client Registration, HTTP+SSE, and includeContext values"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-rs9vry"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-3zh9s4","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:13:05.253Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-lold","kind":"supersedes","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:13:05.253Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-sqvshj","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:13:05.253Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-v7e337","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:13:05.253Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-x705zo","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:13:05.253Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-25T05:13:05.253Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check evidence: searched all statuses for MCP deprecated Roots Sampling Logging Dynamic Client Registration HTTP SSE includeContext ping initialize sessions and migration. Existing terminal issues fix individual old-protocol behavior but no item owns revision-wide removal."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"66514f3b36040ac1e5e4224228a54cb5f159aa3c4d7c5c4e0180abae8ddef2ff","item_hash_version":2,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes